            "text": "Yes, for what it does. It closes air gaps, and air gaps destroy a wall's rating. Titebond's ASTM C919 test shows the same double-layer wall at STC 29 with open edges and STC 53 with two sealed beads. It does not add mass or damping, so it cannot make a basic wall perform like an upgraded one."
